"The diff adds the `temp_condition_min_factor` parameter throughout the full pipeline (types, defaults, invariants, preset exposure, scenario mapping, TOML data, provenance metadata, and tests). The implementation is mechanically correct: the new field is wired into `temp_condition_factor()`, validated by `check_unit_interval`, exposed in all preset dispatch paths, and covered by unit tests that verify both the default floor and a lowered override. The neglected-tank test assertion tightening is safe (deterministic seed). The e2e type alias cleanup is cosmetic and correct. The PROVENANCE_STATUS.md updates are consistent with the TOML metadata. One issue found: the parameter is redundantly present in two preset validation lists with incompatible strictness levels."},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ec2f07c4-9a77-45cd-9635-904ed539d6cf"}
